	 *
	 * <p>From {@code net.runelite.api.gameval.VarbitID.<REGION>_<TIER>_REWARD}, and for Karamja
	 * from {@code ATJUN_EASY_REWARD}, {@code ATJUN_MED_REWARD}, {@code ATJUN_HARD_REWARD} and
